ge Sequence_017_0000.png", "id": "1439689386757080", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75549081_1439689390090413_4681297363425989965_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qAS8jFBPTBoQ7kNvwHyma_c&_nc_oc=AdnzM2VzDlv6AU-ryDDtMJVmUBt_2jp2XHCBero6ufOZf_V3q6iCCtpQVnUm4Mic6IQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftmOqA03hciwFbUkMsnyOHLG0UC5kJclROEHm1WlRgWxw&oe=69A024FF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_011_0000.png", "id": "755989206514620", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86655523_755989209847953_115828304606020556_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rvqm2TxEB3oQ7kNvwFD1-Bk&_nc_oc=AdlecMQPmesPVOL1r97xQWivMtcWlwcIhefZEBGedOu8TnbBQSbNWUwo6bYmU1vFze4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuhvV4fsaR-2wnSnN-egZDz5l-WfOMnN4SXwtVA6j_Ndw&oe=69A02CFF"}, "display_name": "Vokal Pop Up Gallery", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Leading African Women Against Historical Backdrops is a groundbreaking VR experience that transports you to a virtual museum where you'll encounter extraordinary African women who have shaped history.\n\nImmerse Yourself in Their Stories:\n\nEach exhibit features a captivating video interview on the \"front wall\" of a VR museum room. These inspiring women will share their stories directly with you, drawing you into their experiences.\n\nExplore the Context:\n\nThe side panels of the virtual room come alive with rich content that complements each woman's narrative. Informative text and captivating visuals provide historical context, giving you a deeper understanding of the times they lived in.", "short_description": "Leading African Women Against Historical Backdrops."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sisanda.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sisanda Tech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sisanda.c